            "kind": "pull_request",
            "number": "15162"
          },
          "id": "27469383"
        },
        "body": "Ah, I understand.  My mind went to Forgejo's mirroring, and the other `--mirror` related changes aren't as fresh in my memory.  I've proposed a change that follows the same pattern you recently applied to `refs/pull/<N>/head`, as that seems to make sense to me: #15195\r\n\r\n> thinking out loud, maybe a `refs/pull-comment/<prid>/<commentid>/{old,new}` would be easier to manage.\r\n\r\nI'm not opposed to changing it, but I'm not sure how it would be easier to manage in this case.  It would hit the same problem unless we used `hideRefs`, but we could do that with `refs/pull/*/comment/*` too."
      },
